silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_06_dependency_governance_sections_02_dag_acyclicity_law_concrete_anchor_1 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 02_dag_acyclicity_law #1', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section 'DAG Acyclicity as a Path Law' the bare symbol VetRecord anchors to D_Mittens: The colimit diagram D_Mittens: the typed functor J_Mittens to F_04 whose colimit is Mittens. Diagram legs include type-seed, evidence, measurement, quality, role, process, and trace.." .
